GPL-only libraries linked into the wasm:
  x264 — GPL-2.0-or-later — https://code.videolan.org/videolan/x264
  x265 — GPL-2.0-or-later — https://bitbucket.org/multicoreware/x265_git
Other linked libraries (libvpx, libmp3lame, libtheora, libvorbis, libopus,
zlib, libwebp, libfreetype, libfribidi, libass) retain their respective
licenses; see the FFmpeg source tree for details.

